re\tamounts)\n\n|  | 2016 | 2015 | 2014 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Revenue | $60,906 | $58,363 | $58,232 |\n| Operating\\tExpenses: |  |  |  |\n| Compensation\\tand\\tbenefits | 34,770 | 31,028 | 32,045 |\n| Repairs\\tand\\tmaintenance | 1,538 | 1,400 | 1,371 |\n| Depreciation\\tand\\tamortization | 2,224 | 2,084 | 1,923 |\n| Purchased\\ttransportation | 9,129 | 8,043 | 8,460 |\n| Fuel | 2,118 | 2,482 | 3,883 |\n| Other\\toccupancy | 1,037 | 1,022 | 1,044 |\n| Other\\texpenses | 4,623 | 4,636 | 4,538 |\n| Total\\tOperating\\tExpenses | 55,439 | 50,695 | 53,264 |\n| Operating\\tProfit | 5,467 | 7,668 | 4,968 |\n| Other\\tIncome\\tand\\t(Expense): |  |  |  |\n| Investment\\tincome\\tand\\tother | 50 | 15 | 22 |\n| Interest\\texpense | (381) | (341) | (353) |\n| Total\\tOther\\tIncome\\tand\\t(Expense) | (331) | (326) | (331) |\n| Income\\tBefore\\tIncome\\tTaxes | 5,136 | 7,342 | 4,637 |\n| Income\\tTax\\tExpense | 1,705 | 2,498 | 1,605 |\n| Net\\tIncome | $3,431 | $4,844 | $3,032 |\n| Basic\\tEarnings\\tPer\\tShare | $3.89 | $5.38 | $3.31 |\n| Diluted\\tEarnings\\tPer\\tShare | $3.87 | $5.35 | $3.28 |\n\n# STATEMENTS\tOF\tCONSOLIDATED\tCOMPREHENSIVE\tINCOME\t(LOSS)\n\n|  | 2016 | 2015 | 2014 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Net\\tIncome | $3,431 | $4,844 | $3,032 |\n| Change\\tin\\tforeign\\tcurrency\\ttranslation\\tadjustment,\\tnet\\tof\\ttax | (119) | (440) | (331) |\n| Change\\tin\\tunrealized\\tgain\\t(loss)\\ton\\tmarketable\\tsecurities,\\tnet\\tof\\ttax | — | (1) | 1 |\n| Change\\tin\\tunrealized\\tgain\\t(loss)\\ton\\tcash\\tflow\\thedges,\\tnet\\tof\\ttax | (112) | 6 | 280 |\n| Change\\tin\\tunrecognized\\tpension\\tand\\tpostretirement\\tbenefit\\tcosts,\\tnet\\tof\\ttax | (712) | 489 | (3,084) |\n| Comprehensive\\tIncome\\t(Loss) | $2,488 | $4,898 | $(102) |\n\nSee\tnotes\tto\tconsolidated\tfinancial\tstatements.\n\n# STATEMENTS\tOF\tCONSOLIDATED\tCASH\tFLOWS\n\n|  | 2016 | 2015 | 2014 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Cash\\tFlows\\tFrom\\t